            Palmyra by Houndmouth
Watched some live videos to learn this. Simple song, but can add complexity with hammering on/off through out
the song.

The guitarist for the band keeps his guitar 1/2 step down.  SO to play with the record you'd have to drop your
tuning. I typically play standard tuning though.

hide this tab The guitarist plays many different riffs in and out of the chord changes. One progression I play is:
